an></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\">fake.f2 &lt;- sim.geno(fake.f2, n.draws=128, step=1)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\">(out_effplot &lt;- effectplot(fake.f2, mname1=&quot;1@5&quot;, mname2=&quot;1@7&quot;))<br>$Means<br>         1...@7.0.AA 1...@7.0.AB <a rel=\"nofollow\">1...@7.0.BB</a><br>1...@5.0.AA 21.44141 20.17869       NA<br>1...@5.0.AB 22.67253 24.56918 18.60580<br><a rel=\"nofollow\">1...@5.0.BB</a> 17.75186 22.19160 25.44724<br><br>$SEs<br>          1...@7.0.AA  1...@7.0.AB  <a rel=\"nofollow\">1...@7.0.BB</a><br>1...@5.0.AA 0.6455828 4.4105666        NA<br>1...@5.0.AB 5.4346461 0.5265628 9.3071026<br><a rel=\"nofollow\">1...@5.0.BB</a> 4.5490475 6.8012948 0.7549752<br></span><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thursday, July 29, 2021 at 6:26:03 AM UTC-5 <a rel=\"nofollow\">nata...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"direction:ltr\">Hi,</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">I&#39;m using the effectplot() with 2 markers and there&#39;s something wrong with the graph.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">for example:</div><div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><img alt=\"צילום מסך 2021-07-29 142102.png\" width=\"241px\" height=\"309px\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/u/5/group/rqtl-disc/attach/5fb0a07352518/%D7%A6%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%95%D7%9D%20%D7%9E%D7%A1%D7%9A%202021-07-29%20142102.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"></div></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">Here&#39;s the data:</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><div style=\"direction:ltr\">$BDM2$Means</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">                  201323.AA 201323.AB  <a href=\"http://201323.BB\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://201323.BB&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445949247000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3M7XHh6bqeC13DfguK104E\">201323.BB</a></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">51714.AA 0.3368516 0.8748651 0.00000000</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">51714.AB 0.0000000 0.2424017 0.00000000</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><a href=\"http://51714.BB\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://51714.BB&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445949247000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dhFZ4r3OXGHhitVqTNQ5B\">51714.BB</a> 0.0000000 0.2773551 0.06912045</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">$BDM2$SEs</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">                   201323.AA  201323.AB  <a href=\"http://201323.BB\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://201323.BB&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445949247000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3M7XHh6bqeC13DfguK104E\">201323.BB</a></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">51714.AA 0.06789491 0.13684382 0.38972611</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">51714.AB 0.18725105 0.05095344 0.12252230</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><a href=\"http://51714.BB\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://51714.BB&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445949247000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dhFZ4r3OXGHhitVqTNQ5B\">51714.BB</a> 0.38629296 0.14511003 0.07196057</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">Thanks a lot,</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">Nataly</div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div>"
